Box 51481, threads 49281 and 49284, 2 of 2: „სად მუშაობს ბახვა?" was
answered with the job and then „შევინახე: ბახვა, სამუშაო ადგილი: …"
though only search_contact_by_name ran. When the owner's line is a
question and no saving tool ran in the run, the sentences that say „I
saved / noted" are taken out; the answer stays. „შენახულია" (it is
saved) is left alone, and a reply that is only the claim is not emptied.

